Route wasm32-wasip1 through Rust std's libc-backed socket implementation.
agentOS supplies the POSIX socket, DNS, option, and poll functions through its
owned libc and host_net imports, so the stock WASIp1 Unsupported implementation
is the wrong backend for this sysroot.

